  >
    <p class="mb-4">P1 階段建置中</p>
    <p class="text-sm">精選專案策展 · GitHub API 自動列表</p>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/u8961310"
      class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-lg bg-dev-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:opacity-90"
